,"FireManiac":[255,130,40],"Fool":[255,120,200],"Hunter":[255,255,255],"Killer":[230,70,80],"Lover":[255,255,255],"Lurker":[255,255,255],"Ninja":[255,255,255],"PlagueDoctor":[255,255,255],"Police":[255,255,255],"Priest":[255,255,255],"Pup":[255,221,51],"Seer":[255,255,255],"Sheriff":[255,255,255],"Thief":[255,255,255],"Villager":[255,255,255],"Wolf":[255,221,51]},"tutorial":[{"body":"Up to 12 villagers live here, and one of them is secretly a werewolf. The village must find it before it eats everyone. Nobody knows anyone's role.","icons":["Villager","Wolf","Villager"],"title":"Who is the werewolf?"},{"body":"Do your task of the day for coins. After 3 minutes anyone can ring the bell on the meeting table. At the meeting everyone votes; at least 2 votes are needed to throw someone out.","icons":["Chief","Villager","Sheriff"],"title":"The day"},{"body":"At night everyone is sent into a house. The werewolf breaks doors and searches beds and wardrobes. Hide under the bed or in the wardrobe! The monster can always see you in the forest. Be careful!","icons":["Wolf","Pup"],"title":"The night"},{"body":"Before the match, pick 3 roles you own; you get one of them. Each role has a power. Use it with caution: the one you're helping might not be on your side!","icons":["Doctor","Seer","Bodyguard","Priest","Engineer"],"title":"Roles"},{"body":"They win by their own rules. They're not on your side, so don't get fooled by them!","icons":["Killer","Fool","FireManiac"],"title":"Special roles"},{"body":"Survive the nights as long as you can, until the wolves are finished! Good luck!","icons":["Villager","Sheriff","Doctor"],"title":"Survive!"}]}